  content:
    "[quote]With Kailuva by my side, I'm delighted to live in interesting times!|Tuiravi[/quote]\r\n\r\nKailuva Sikuvael is a @[snow elven](ethnicity:4196c7ca-6679-46b7-a36e-c6ed8be75b3d) diplomat and explorer of the @[Nisrei](organization:5177657a-0219-4b38-ae53-0f19254114e2), formally holding the role of the @[Mountain's Eyes](profession:551e2258-31eb-4c3a-9b92-a555bf8430e1). Though originally based in @[Mount Firanthul](location:ddb13ca3-8197-4a55-bcf7-0a2e12f08265), Kailuva moved to @[the Tower of Sathelis](settlement:4aec5ad0-3a70-4b5e-981c-7007477118e1) to live with his wife, @[Tuiravi Amliris](person:ffc6b847-a340-453e-8de9-f5c549e7f517), shortly after their wedding.\r\n\r\nThough not an adventurer by any standards, Kailuva has developed a reputation for ending up in the most bizarre of places. Unlike many snow elves, he has travelled across many continents whilst carrying out his duties as the Mountain's Eyes, and has found himself stuck in many new and often bizarre situations along the way. He is a @[ranger](profession:c6c82fb0-3889-4f9d-8245-34ca82346ab8) by class, and so possesses some @[divine](technology:97a9e2b1-1ae3-412b-b915-f24e093cc3bf) abiliites to help him escape these tight spots. His wife (who often intervenes to help) refers to his luck as brilliant, but [i]highly[/i] cursed.\r\n\r\nKailuva and Tuiravi have three children: the arcane scholar @[Vairani](person:f6aadd39-6ade-4d37-be4d-0592894ff92d), the hunter-in-training @[Huiriase](person:d16bd0be-27a7-4adf-a3c9-4cc77375a070), and their surprise bonus child @[Iulómë](person:c647e2b7-ad8e-4188-bb09-0541837e01a7).",
