    "[container:art-pic]\r\n[img:4195989]\r\n[/container]\r\n\r\n[container:art-pic]\r\n[img:4699254]\r\n[/container]\r\n\r\n[container:art-pic]\r\n[img:4699257]\r\n[/container]\r\n\r\n[quote]Don't you think we've got enough wolves?|a doubtful Kailuva to an unrepentant Tuiravi[/quote]\r\n\r\n[container:infobox]\r\n[h2]The Wolves[/h2]\r\nKailuva and Tuiravi have five snow wolves, each larger than the next. The largest, Halceleth, is Tuiravi's personal mount. Whilst Kailuva himself has never particularly claimed one, his wife makes it very much known that Kailuva [i]actually[/i] belongs to Mialyana, her wolf's mate.\r\n[/container]\r\n\r\n[quote]Would you really deprive our fluffy loves their family, darling?|Tuiravi to Kailuva[/quote]\r\n\r\n[container:art-pic]\r\n[img:4699451]\r\n[/container]\r\n\r\n[quote]Oh, yeah, the oldest is pregnant again. I think my mother said she's naming the next one after my father's hair.|Vairani on the wolves, in earshot of her father[/quote]",
