  physique:
    "[row]\r\n[container:col-md-4]\r\n[container:art-pic]\r\n[img:4699454]\r\n[/container]\r\n[/container]\r\n[container:col-md-8]\r\nKailuva is a tall and not particularly muscular elf who nonetheless possesses fantastic dexterity, which he relies on greatly every time he manages to walk into just about every trap in a dungeon. He barely shows his age, like many elves, except in his loud complaints about not being able to get around so easily anymore and in how he'll often be found riding his wife's wolves around instead of making the walk himself. \r\n\r\nHe wears a number of scars as proof of his travels, most significant among them being the white scar over one eye that marks his status as one watched over by the desert's draconic population - not that he's wholly certain what that means or entails. He's also begun decorating his arms with similar tattoos to his wife, infused with magic just the same as hers.\r\n\r\nThese decorations paint the story of his life onto his arms, celebrating his adventures and misadventures, his love, and the three children of whom he is ardently proud.\r\n[/container]\r\n[/row]",
